    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n48128" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεμιστ-εύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>declare law and right</i>, c. dat., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μίνωα ἴδον . . θεμιστεύοντα νέκυσσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					11.569
				</span></i>
			: c. gen., <i>govern</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θ. δὲ ἕκαστος παίδων ἠδ᾽ ἀλόχων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					9.114
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>give by way of answer</i> or <i>oracle</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νημερτέα βουλὴν πᾶσι θ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Ap.</u>
				253
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				23S.
			</span></i>: abs., <i>deliver oracles</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ion</u>
				371
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				5.67
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Alex.</u>
				14
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινα</span> Orac. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>VH</u>
				3.43
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεμιτεύω</span>.</div>
